//Twist  180X

 FORM BLOCK
EDIT BLOCK RESET
BLOCK ACCEPT

MODE WORKPLANE_CREATE ; INTERACTIVE BLOCK
 MACRO PAUSE " SELECT POINT FOR NEW WORKPLANE"
EXPLORER SELECT Workplane "#" NEW
ACTIVATE WORKPLANE "#"
FORM BLOCK
EDIT BLOCK RESET
MODE WORKPLANE_EDIT START "#"
MODE WORKPLANE_EDIT TWIST X
MODE WORKPLANE_EDIT TWIST "180"
WPETWIST ACCEPT
MODE WORKPLANE_EDIT FINISH ACCEPT

 FORM BLOCK
EDIT BLOCK RESET
BLOCK ACCEPT
ROTATE TRANSFORM TOP